"markdown": "### Version 0.1.4\n- Added an option to minimize apps into the notch when swiping up to return to the Home Screen. Turn it on in Settings.\n- Fixed notification taps failing to open the corresponding message in apps such as QQ, and the system call banner flashing again after hang-up.\n- Fixed notch alerts lingering after dismissing an alarm or expired timer, or resetting the stopwatch. A paused stopwatch shows its reading for about three seconds before closing.",
